# What EAS Build uploads. mobile/eas.json has requireCommit, so EAS clones the
# committed tree (never local worktrees, .env or untracked files), then drops
# everything matched here: the app needs only mobile/ (no root package.json).
# This file replaces .gitignore for EAS, including its managed-workflow check:
# local mobile/ios and mobile/android (prebuild output) must stay ignored, or
# EAS treats the app as bare and skips prebuild.
/*
!/mobile/
!/.git
/mobile/ios
/mobile/android
